              <div id="psind2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Adoption is critical. We: (1) Design workflows to match how your firm works, (2) Make time entry and tasks as easy as possible (mobile, one-click, automation), (3) Provide training and change management, (4) Get leadership buy-in, (5) Show quick wins to build momentum.</div>
