              <div id="psind3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We integrate with QuickBooks Online, Xero, NetSuite, Sage Intacct, and others. We sync clients, projects, time, expenses, invoices, payments. For custom or legacy systems we build custom integrations.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#psind5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="psind5">How do you measure success and ROI?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="psind5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We track: billable utilization, project profitability, time capture, collections performance (DSO), admin time reduced, and client satisfaction. We set baselines during discovery and measure improvements post-launch.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#psind6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="psind6">Can we customize it for our unique workflows?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="psind6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We build flexible platforms for your processes, billing models, deliverables, and client needs. Customization is expected for success.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#psind7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="psind7">What happens to our historical project and financial data?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="psind7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We migrate historical clients, projects, time, invoices, and financial data. This preserves reporting and provides baselines. Migration is validated for accuracy.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#psind8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="psind8">Do you provide training for our team?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="psind8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We provide admin and super-user training, end-user sessions (live and recorded), documentation and help, ongoing support during rollout, and refresher training for new hires. Training is tailored by role (partners, PMs, consultants, admin).</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#psind9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="psind9">Can we start with just time tracking and add features later?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="psind9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Absolutely. We recommend phased: start with time tracking and basic project management for quick wins, then add resource planning, billing, client portals, and analytics. This spreads cost and reduces change risk.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#psind10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="psind10">What ongoing support do you provide?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="psind10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#professionalServicesFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We offer support packages: technical support, software updates, new-hire training, process optimization, integration maintenance, reporting and analytics. Support can be full-service or train-your-team.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

